      "effect": "The broad rectangular lower hair mass and shallow overlapping-looking bumps read as a bumpy cap. In E/W its low straight boundary runs through the spectacles/temples, hiding the useful eyewear profile and making the hairstyle dominate the character rather than read as Ellis short blue-black hair. Front and back small lumps appear partially buried under larger oval forms. This misses frozen rank1 coherent hair/shape and rank4 crafted detail despite otherwise useful softening.",
      "desiredVisibleOutcome": "A coherent softly rounded short hairstyle with purposeful lock flow and an intentional fringe/temple/ear transition in all four facings. Keep the spectacle arms/outer rim visually legible in profile, and replace the broad straight lower wall plus residual-looking bumps with clear hair forms. Preserve the already-passing rig, camera, dynamic envelopes, contacts and canonical food mapping; no original part counts or old mesh coordinates are required."
